{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4cc58028f274225e90a33a8bc51011ee3d960a6f7a2d8eea2ba0634e6012da5b", "ja": "（『昏き星、遠い月』の公演が近付き、みんなの\nレッスンに熱が入ってきた。中でも熱心なのは……）", "zh": "（『昏暗之星，遥远之月』的公演即将来临，\n大家都卯足了劲在训练课程上。其中最勤奋的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "d4fc47f9da04a084b401235cbc5c7e9f1d012a6922903db3549c50539234b1f2", "ja": "あら、{$P$}。\nちょうど良かったですわ。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}。\n你来得正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "396d0cf9bfca5da32c5b3c39d4308b268df5ad8303df35f1611e4dd72a6731e5", "ja": "わたくし、{$P$}に\n聞きたいことがありましたの。", "zh": "本小姐有事情，\n想请教{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ee94c768578cefcc73349812c788f914e5e3dd9e51be97ade70b8a2bc5f334fe", "ja": "聞きたいこと、ですか？", "zh": "有事情想问我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "37d0f3dbc0a13b42cfbffdff30bb9f2e963f79f5674be228f4ca6e9e20e63eeb", "ja": "ええ。あ、あくまで役作りの上の、\nちょっとした疑問なのですが。その……。", "zh": "对，就、就只是关于角色揣摩方面，\n有一点小问题而已。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "c485fe5581ef94aeea2febf25c0d1095cdc404d88d11bcbd50054e4edf4d2ffd", "ja": "もし……もし、ですわよ？　{$P$}が\nアレクサンドラの妹の、ノエルだったら……。", "zh": "如果……只是如果喔！{$P$}，\n假如你是亚历山大的妹妹，诺艾儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "fc0c9a9f52f18de2b3904d6f710157e0bddbbd98637285d2f6a0b28befabba33", "ja": "本当のことを話して欲しいと思いまして？\nその真実が、喜ばしいことではなかったとしても……。", "zh": "你会希望听到实话吗？\n即便事情的真相不是值得欣喜的内容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "880198e2d52012f7d9a8b4957bedfccf3f5ee25c458ce127cd3e6fea3330469e", "ja": "優しい嘘なら……いえ、たとえどんな理由であれ、\n嘘をつかれるのはイヤですわよね……？", "zh": "如果是善意的谎言……不，不管理由为何，\n人都不会喜欢遭到欺瞒对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6f1393bc0d70c6eb729b2ede7bca62912c563e1a0896fe5bea4f6dfdefb7476a", "ja": "うーん、そうですね……。", "zh": "嗯，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_1009", "source_sha256": "079dd5336c35e18cac60fb06d654c9bc96528faa0d43ff00c11675e897bb8405", "ja": "理由による", "zh": "要视理由而定", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9fb1045f870fa497a185c0ae9160d577e2ce210d02c3e89bdc761069483068f3", "ja": "理由によるんじゃないかと思います。アレクサンドラは\n大切な妹だからこそ、ウソをついたんでしょうし……。", "zh": "我觉得要看对方说谎的理由。\n我想亚历山大是为了宝贝的妹妹，才会选择说谎……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2001_038chz", "source_sha256": "72fbbda694e1a252438a49711afa64fc3506772323ff1fe1a44752e719014e4c", "ja": "それは……そうですわね。けど、大切な人につく嘘が、\n必ずしもそういう理由とは限りませんわ……。", "zh": "这么说……是没错。可是，对珍视的人撒下的谎言，\n不见得都是出于那样的理由……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2002_p", "source_sha256": "002f445a677e09ad73a6ca81d87a086c3f418adc46dfaabb5fa33373efb5d117", "ja": "なら……俺は、\n相手の人が話してくれるのを、待とうと思います。", "zh": "这样的话……我想，\n我会选择等待对方说出真相。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2003_p", "source_sha256": "0581657723c44263562ae90e08faa2e2ebaa5377f2b0926e3934e1dae549e9fb", "ja": "それに、本当の事を言うと、どっちでもいいんです。\n嘘をつかれていても、いなくても。", "zh": "而且说老实话，我两者都可以接受。\n不论对方是隐瞒真相，还是如实坦白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2004_038chz", "source_sha256": "0c7f561c5f3274a87f3678bd02265eb2a3f57cdee5e098ad869341ee94a8a04e", "ja": "ど、どっちでもいい！？", "zh": "两、两者都可以接受！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2005_p", "source_sha256": "5f83b15729c26a82120208ed8afd432852b2c5a51906a30f297c52e45ab6c1de", "ja": "はい。大事なのは、目の前にいるその人ですから。\nその人の事が信じられれば、大丈夫だって思います。", "zh": "没错，因为真正重要的，是自己眼前的那个人。\n只要信得过那个人，我觉得就没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2006_038chz", "source_sha256": "3b95dd8a0b3aeefc48bc959138f84d7aa9d2bd12759864865fb022c135ebe1a1", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nもう、貴方という方は、とんだお人好しですわね。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n真受不了你这个人，心肠居然好成这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2007_038chz", "source_sha256": "b933da4399c092c5bda93ec89ff39393dbdaceeab928cc0fde6cd9912d5aac1e", "ja": "そんなことでは、いつか悪い人間に\nだまされてしまうかもしれませんわよ？", "zh": "按你这种个性，\n哪天说不定会遇上坏人受骗上当喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2008_p", "source_sha256": "4c07e2f93f22174efb5411806a3b0295ba42493fe74b125cb0a4f479442ffc32", "ja": "はは……そうですね、気をつけます。", "zh": "哈哈……说得也是，我会当心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2009_038chz", "source_sha256": "d55139314d17f408bb10848a60fa6b135ec2b182744161f6a981cfd3f4d1de79", "ja": "でも、勇気……そうですわね……。\nわたくしもいつか、そんな勇気を持てたら……。", "zh": "不过，勇气……说得没有错呢……\n要是哪天，本小姐也能提起那样的勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2010_p", "source_sha256": "1e687813a213fac8a9d48854a627200cb69c8e01a78c6b3b76e8c8e317c080c8", "ja": "アレクサンドラの話なのに、そんなに真剣に……。\n千鶴さん、役に入り込んでますね。本番が楽しみです。", "zh": "明明是在讲亚历山大，却这么认真……\n千鹤真的很投入角色呢。我很期待正式演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0043_2011_038chz", "source_sha256": "246322864123b1a582a1a2ef4ca1ae286ce3860ca4017a540c75d983d42ae216", "ja": "えっ！？　え、ええ。そのとおりですわ！\nこの公演、わたくしが必ず成功させてみせますわよ！", "zh": "咦！？对、对啊，你说得没错！\n这次公演，本小姐一定会让它圆满成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
